{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_06D470","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"Coldman为什么要真的发射核武？如果只是证明<R=人工智能,AI>的报复功能，应该没必要搭载核弹头。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=人工智能,AI>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":128,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"没错。就算不装弹头，只发射导弹本体，也足以证明报复功能。我一开始听到的也是这样。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":120,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"但那家伙说模拟弹没有意义……真正发射过核武这一事实本身，才会成为对假想敌的威慑。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":120,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"通过发射真正的核武，在和<R=总部,LANGLEY>谈判时取得优势。这也是他的目的。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=总部,LANGLEY>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":102,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"}]}